Description: Backport the Dolby Vision layer-splitting bitstream filter
 Add dovi_split with its bl, bl_rpu, el and el_rpu modes, plus the
 enhancement-layer HEVC configuration side data and MP4/Matroska readers
 needed when the EL parameter sets are stored in the container.
 .
 Add an opt-in downstream fix_el_timing mode that automatically validates
 EL timestamps against HEVC picture order, preserves correctly ordered
 packet properties, and repairs timestamp association on a best-effort basis.
 Mark untrusted EL for compositor fallback when timing cannot be established.
 Keep the upstream default packet-copy path unchanged.
 .
 Preserve the upstream AV_PKT_DATA_HEVC_CONF value by reserving the preceding enum slot
 for AV_PKT_DATA_DYNAMIC_HDR_SMPTE_2094_APP5, which is absent in FFmpeg 8.1.
 Omit upstream version bumps, release notes and unrelated muxer/stream-group
 changes. The filter does not convert Dolby Vision profiles or reconstruct FEL.
